{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2021-05-10 16:35:00', 'title': "STATE STREET ANNOUNCES CHAIRMAN & CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER TO PARTICIPATE IN BERNSTEIN'S ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE", 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE:STT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS CHAIRMAN & CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, RON O'HANLEY, AND ITS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, ERIC ABOAF, WILL PARTICIPATE IN BERNSTEIN'S ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE, TO BE HELD VIRTUALLY, ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 2, 2021, AT 10:00 AM ET. THE WEBCAST OF THE EVENT WILL BE ACCESSIBLE ON STATE STREET'S INVESTOR RELATIONS HOME PAGE AT INVESTORS.STATESTREET.COM. A RECORDED REPLAY OF THE SESSION WILL BE AVAILABLE ON TH"}